{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56108","headline":"步虚词 一 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旋行蹑云纲，乘虚步玄纪。\n吟咏帝一尊，百关自调理。\n俯命八海暗示，仰携高仙子。\n诸天散香花，萧然灵风起。\n宿愿定命根，故致标高拟。\n欢乐太上前，万劫犹未始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}